  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mexico Office 1% support 2024-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">During this biennium the office in Mexico will participate in the formulation of a new Sustainable Development Cooperation Framework and create a new UNESCO Country Strategy. 
The coordination team will meet at the beginning of 2024 and 2025 to discuss the priorities of the year, and in 2025, they will also advance in the formulation of the UCS. 
This biennium is particularly important because in 2024 a new government takes office, and in 2025 a new development plan and a new UNSDCF will be issued. Our efforts should be well planed and coordinated to contribute efficiently at the country level.</narrative>
  </description>
